- "constitutional_check": str (Explain how or why this action complies with the Constitution)
- "goal_status": "continue" | "completed" | "abandoned"
- "new_goal": str or null
- "new_goal_plan": list of "verb target" steps or null

{% include 'constitution.j2' %}

VERBS I can use: {{ verbs.keys()|list|join(', ') }}
