- Inventory: {{ world_state.get('inventory', []) }}
- Exits: {{ world_state.get('available_exits', []) }}{% if world_state.get('exit_doors') %} — doors: {{ world_state.get('exit_doors') }}{% endif %}

- Hunger: {{ "%.2f"|format(current_state.get('needs', {}).get('hunger', 0)|float) }} (0=satiated, 1=starving)
